OL,3,GNEWSA'Our Roma community faces hate and
OL,4,Adivision daily'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of a support group for the
OL,7,FRoma community says families experience
OL,8,F"hate and division" every day.
OL,10,FSimona Lazar, chief executive of the
OL,11,FSuffolk charity Union Romani Voice,
OL,12,Fsaid anti-immigrant demonstrations in
OL,13,Fother parts of Britain were having a
OL,14,Fnegative impact on the community.
OL,16,FSpeaking at a conference as part of
OL,17,FHate Crime Awareness Week, she said:
OL,18,F"It did not start with these
OL,19,Fdemonstrations, it started quite a few
OL,20,Fyears ago, post-Brexit [with people]
OL,21,Funcertain about what will go on, what
OL,22,Fwill happen next."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
