OL,3,GNEWSA'Our Roma community faces hate and
OL,4,Adivision daily'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event, organised with the Suffolk
OL,7,FLaw Centre, was held in Ipswich on
OL,8,FWednesday, with about 60 participants
OL,9,Fincluding police, teachers and Roma
OL,10,Ffamilies.
